@startuml
' SPDX-FileCopyrightText: Copyright (C) 2026 Tim Perkins
' SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
'
' Rendered to ownership.svg by 'make diagrams'. GitHub does not render
' PlantUML, so the SVG beside this file is what docs/deployment.md shows;
' regenerate it in the same commit as any edit here.
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 160
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam ArrowFontSize 13
hide empty description

skinparam state {
  BorderColor #444444
  FontColor #111111
  BackgroundColor<<good>> #E8F2E4
  BorderColor<<good>> #4C7A34
  BackgroundColor<<bad>> #FBEDE7
  BorderColor<<bad>> #A8452A
  BackgroundColor<<dead>> #F0F0F0
  BorderColor<<dead>> #999999
  FontColor<<dead>> #444444
}

state "**Owned**\nthe manifest records every file cairn wrote" as Owned <<good>>
state "**Unclaimed**\nthe output is still there, the manifest is not" as Unclaimed <<bad>>
state "build refused\non the first file" as Refused <<dead>>
state "nothing written,\nnothing claimed" as Frozen <<dead>>

[*] --> Owned : first build
Owned --> Unclaimed : rsync --delete, git clean, or a\nmanifest this cairn cannot parse
Unclaimed --> Refused : build
Unclaimed --> Frozen : build, on_conflict skip
Refused -[dashed]-> Unclaimed : neither one\nchanges the tree
Frozen -[dashed]-> Unclaimed
Unclaimed --> Owned : build --adopt
@enduml
